<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Desk Bridge – third-party licenses</title>
<style>
body { font: 14px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; color: #21264e; max-width: 900px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; } h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f6e9df; padding: .75rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12px; }
.used-by { color: #555; font-size: 12px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>Desk Bridge is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0. It uses the following open source components.
FFmpeg (LGPL 2.1+) is loaded as separate DLLs (shared build, no GPL components); Montserrat is licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1;
the bundled virtual display driver is MIT licensed (see <code>drivers/display/LICENSE</code>).</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p class="used-by">Used by:
{{#each used_by}}{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}</p>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
